Red Teaming: Job Roles, Salaries & Opportunities


Red teamers in India with certifications (e.g., OSCP, CEH) can expect to earn an average of ₹18 Lakhs to ₹40 Lakhs per annum as of early 2026, depending on experience. Certified mid-level professionals typically earn 12 LPA to 20 LPA, while experienced senior consultants can reach 25 LPA to 40 LPA or higher


